- Summary: Upgraded problem-solving workspace to professional LeetCode standards:
  1. Dual Independent Splitters: Built vertical splitter (Problem Statement vs Editor/Console) with 20%–80% ratio constraints, and horizontal splitter (Monaco Editor vs Console) with 150px/100px minimum bounds.
