  4. Typography Engine: Created `FormattedProblemStatement.tsx` transforming inline identifiers into LeetCode-style code pills (`.dsa-code-pill`), styled example callout boxes, and formatted constraints.
  5. Execution Console: Styled `ExecutionConsole.tsx` with LeetCode-matching empty state ("You must run your code first"), runtime/memory percentile benchmark chips, and failure analysis breakdown.
  6. ProblemTimer React 19 Fix: Resolved `setState` in render error by decoupling duration callbacks through `timerDurationRef`.
  7. Automated Tests: Added `tests/workspace-splitters-and-typography.test.ts`. 100% passing.
